# Committed to the repo on purpose. None of these are secrets — the
# Supabase anon key + URL and the Cloudinary cloud name + upload preset
# are all designed to be public in a client bundle (real protection comes
# from Postgres Row Level Security and the Cloudinary preset's own
# scoping, not from hiding these values). Committing them here means
# `npm run build` always has them, on any host, regardless of how that
# host's dashboard handles build-time vs runtime environment variables.
